# Dialog

Modal dialog with focus trap, scroll lock, and Escape dismissal.

<div class="demo-card">
	<Dialog.Root bind:open>
		<Dialog.Trigger class="demo-btn">
			Open dialog (currently {open ? 'open' : 'closed'})
		</Dialog.Trigger>
		<Dialog.Portal>
			<Dialog.Overlay class="fixed inset-0 bg-black/50" />
			<Dialog.Content
				class="fixed top-1/2 left-1/2 w-full max-w-md -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-lg border bg-card p-6 shadow-lg"
